id=apatch_chroot
name=APatch Chroot
version=v0.3.0
versionCode=4
author=Developer-lfierro743
description=Run Linux containers on Android via a privileged daemon that bypasses the app seccomp filter. Docker Hub pull, private-namespace mounts (host audio stays intact), PTY shells. v0.3.0: fixed exec bare-command crash (resolve against guest PATH — no more 'No module named warnings'), login/run use a real login shell (bash -l), working 'info' command, --shared-display GUI via termux-x11 (namespace-safe), setuser/--user/--root least privilege, convert --move (instant rename, zero extra space), suid remount so sudo works, mini-systemd init + systemctl shim, optional box64. Full docs wiki + SECURITY.md.
sourceRepo=https://github.com/Developer-lfierro743/apatch-chroot
